# Changelog — user only

Do **not** create, edit, or update [CHANGELOG.md](CHANGELOG.md) unless the user explicitly asks you to change the changelog in that request.

- Do not add release notes, version sections, or bullet lists to CHANGELOG as part of other tasks.
- If a task would normally include a changelog entry, skip it and mention in your summary that the user can update CHANGELOG when they release.

The user maintains the changelog; that is not the agent’s job in this project.
